{
 "title": "Finding POs",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Finding POs</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"Find your purchase orders (POs) to display the status of ordered items or services.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Find your purchase orders (POs) to display the status of ordered items or services.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page task  - topic-topic task-task \" id=\"loio71470a525cca492396a0b829511470c8\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Finding POs</h1><div class=\"body taskbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">Find your purchase orders (POs) to display the status of ordered items or\nservices.</p>\n<div class=\"section context\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Context</h2></div>\n<p class=\"p\">After requisitions have been fully approved, guided buying creates POs (one per\nsupplier), sends them to suppliers, and sets their status to\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Ordered</span>. PO numbers display below requests after they reach\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Ordered</span> state, as shown in the following figure.</p>\n<p class=\"p\"><img class=\"inline\" id=\"loio71470a525cca492396a0b829511470c8__image_bjz_ywk_dzb\" src=\"loioc1933f5ae01940dca90ab5acddd93dbb_LowRes.jpg\" alt=\"The purchase requisition displays a link to the purchase order as PO10166.\" title=\"The purchase requisition displays a link to the purchase order as PO10166.\"></p>\n<div class=\"p\">POs display information from order confirmations and ship notices sent by suppliers, and\nfrom your receipts and service entry sheets. Find this information to determine the\nlocation of your ordered items or when services will be supplied.<aside class=\"note\" aria-labelledby=\"n0t\"><div class=\"title\" id=\"n0t\"><strong>Note</strong></div>\n<p class=\"p\">Order confirmations display for material orders, not service orders.</p></aside>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"section procedure\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"ol steps tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Procedure</h2></div><ol class=\"ol steps\"><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">On the home page, choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Your requests</span>.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Find the PO by doing any of the following:</span>\n<ul class=\"ul choices\" id=\"loio71470a525cca492396a0b829511470c8__choices_mkk_3y3_czb\">\n<li class=\"li choice\"><p>Scroll through the list of all types of requests on the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Recent\nrequests</span> page. </p><aside class=\"note\" aria-labelledby=\"n1t\"><div class=\"title\" id=\"n1t\"><strong>Note</strong></div>\n<p class=\"p\">Requests are sorted by the date they were last changed.</p></aside></li>\n<li class=\"li choice\"><p>Find the PO in the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Purchase orders</span> tab or the\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">To receive</span> tab. The POs available in <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">To\nReceive</span> are the same POs available in <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Purchase\norders</span>.</p><aside class=\"note\" aria-labelledby=\"n2t\"><div class=\"title\" id=\"n2t\"><strong>Note</strong></div>\n<p class=\"p\">The filters <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Request ID</span>, <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Order\nID</span>, <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Request title</span>, <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Supplier\nID</span>, and <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Supplier name</span> return any\nrequests that contains the searched string of text.</p></aside></li>\n</ul>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Review the PO status and basic information, as shown in the following figure.\n<img class=\"inline\" id=\"loio71470a525cca492396a0b829511470c8__image_iby_lq1_qw\" src=\"loiob92c25788bcf46b0898e24f36f44d73e_LowRes.png\" alt=\"The purchase order displays the status of the requisition, number or items confirmed, shipped, and received, the estimated delivery date, supplier, shipping, billing, and payment information.\" title=\"The purchase order displays the status of the requisition, number or items confirmed, shipped, and received, the estimated delivery date, supplier, shipping, billing, and payment information.\">\n</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\">The following table lists the sections in this area:</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table border=\"1\" frame=\"border\" rules=\"rows\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\" summary=\"\" class=\"simpletable choicetable choicetableborder\" id=\"loio71470a525cca492396a0b829511470c8__choicetable_h2c_tlg_tlb\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><thead><tr class=\"sthead chhead\"><th class=\"stentry choptionhd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d17977e136-option\">Section</th><th class=\"stentry chdeschd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d17977e136-desc\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e136-option\" id=\"d17977e149\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p class=\"p\">\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Status</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e136-desc d17977e149\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p class=\"p\">Graphic indicators of the fulfillment status of the PO. Each graphic\nrepresents the total quantity of all line items in the PO.</p><p class=\"p\">The following information is displayed:</p><ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio71470a525cca492396a0b829511470c8__ul_nzg_zzw_5lb\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Confirmed</span>: The number of ordered items or services\nthat the supplier can deliver. If the supplier rejected items, they\ndisplay here, too.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Shipped</span>: (For material POs) The number of ordered\nitems that have been shipped by the supplier.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Received</span>: (For material POs) The number of items\nor amount that you have received. To receive ordered items or by amount,\ngo to the <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Your requests</span> page and choose the\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">To receive</span> tab.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Serviced</span>: (For service POs) The amount of work\nperformed or services delivered.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Estimated delivery/Serviced date</span>: The date when\nthe ordered items or services will be delivered.</p></li>\n</ul></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e136-option\" id=\"d17977e209\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p class=\"p\">\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Supplier</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e136-desc d17977e209\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p class=\"p\">The name, address, and contact information of the supplier.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e136-option\" id=\"d17977e227\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p class=\"p\">\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Bill to</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e136-desc d17977e227\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p class=\"p\">The address to which the supplier sends invoices.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e136-option\" id=\"d17977e245\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p class=\"p\">\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Ship to / Deliver to</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e136-desc d17977e245\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p class=\"p\">The address and contact to which the supplier will send the items or perform\nthe service. If the PO contains multiple ship-to or deliver-to addresses,\nchoose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">more locations</span> to display them.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e136-option\" id=\"d17977e267\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p class=\"p\">\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Payment terms</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e136-desc d17977e267\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p class=\"p\">Payment terms agreed upon by the supplier and your organization. This\nsection also lists the gross amount of the PO.</p><p class=\"p\">Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Details</span> to see the monetary amount ordered,\nreceived, and invoiced.</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Scroll down to display the line item details, as shown in the following figure.\n<img class=\"inline\" id=\"loio71470a525cca492396a0b829511470c8__image_bb1_fzk_qmb\" src=\"loio9d7c2dd096ed48ca8276f50583703bbb_LowRes.png\" alt=\"Each line item contains the quantity, price, amount, shipping address, comments, attachments, and terms and conditions.\" title=\"Each line item contains the quantity, price, amount, shipping address, comments, attachments, and terms and conditions.\">\n</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\">The following table lists the sections in this area:</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table border=\"1\" frame=\"border\" rules=\"rows\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\" summary=\"\" class=\"simpletable choicetable choicetableborder\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><thead><tr class=\"sthead chhead\"><th class=\"stentry choptionhd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d17977e308-option\">Section</th><th class=\"stentry chdeschd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d17977e308-desc\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e308-option\" id=\"d17977e321\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p class=\"p\">\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Items</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e308-desc d17977e321\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p class=\"p\">The line items in the PO including their descriptions.</p><p class=\"p\">Material items display quantity, price, and amount.</p><p class=\"p\">Service items display start date, end date, expected amount, maximum amount,\nnet amount, and gross amount.</p><p class=\"p\">Line items might also display delivery addresses, comments, and\nattachments..</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e308-option\" id=\"d17977e348\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Terms and conditions</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e308-desc d17977e348\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Purchasing terms and conditions agreed upon by the supplier and your\norganization.</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e308-option\" id=\"d17977e360\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Guidelines for suppliers</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e308-desc d17977e360\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p>Optional, predefined notes that provide additional information for\nsuppliers that you can add to requests.</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Scroll down to display related documents and history, as shown in the following\nfigures:</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\"><div class=\"fig fignone\" id=\"id-43857-loio71470a525cca492396a0b829511470c8--fig-134-47-73\"><div class=\"figbody\">\n\n</div><span class=\"figcap\">Related documents and history sections</span></div><img class=\"inline\" src=\"loio06dab8c75e924999b354202592a981dd_LowRes.png\" alt=\"The related documents section displays the document ID, type, date created, and status. The history section displays the purchase order history, associated users, and a summary.\" title=\"The related documents section displays the document ID, type, date created, and status. The history section displays the purchase order history, associated users, and a summary.\"></div>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\">The following table lists the sections in this area:</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table border=\"1\" frame=\"border\" rules=\"rows\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\" summary=\"\" class=\"simpletable choicetable choicetableborder\" id=\"loio71470a525cca492396a0b829511470c8__choicetable_k2r_5zk_qmb\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><col style=\"width:50%\"><thead><tr class=\"sthead chhead\"><th class=\"stentry choptionhd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d17977e395-option\">Section</th><th class=\"stentry chdeschd\" style=\"vertical-align:bottom;text-align:left;\" id=\"d17977e395-desc\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e395-option\" id=\"d17977e408\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p class=\"p\">\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Related documents</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e395-desc d17977e408\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p class=\"p\">A list of documents that affect the PO, the dates they were created, and\ntheir current status; choose them to display them.</p><p class=\"p\">The available documents are:</p><ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio71470a525cca492396a0b829511470c8__ul_lvt_f4g_tlb\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Order confirmations</span>: sent by the supplier to\nindicate that they received PO and whether they can deliver the ordered\nitems or services. Order confirmations display for material orders, not\nservice orders.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Ship notices</span>: sent by the supplier either before or\nafter shipping to indicate the name of the shipper and provide a delivery\ndate.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Receipts</span>: created by you or your organization to\naccept delivered items.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p>\n<span class=\"ph emphasis emphasis\">Service entry sheets</span>: created by the supplier or\nyour organization to indicate that services were delivered. These\ndocuments display in <span class=\"ph\">SAP Ariba Procurement solutions</span>.</p></li>\n</ul></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"strow chrow\">\n<th style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e395-option\" id=\"d17977e459\" class=\"stentry choption\"><p class=\"p\">\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">History</span>\n</p></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:top;\" headers=\"d17977e395-desc d17977e459\" class=\"stentry chdesc\"><p class=\"p\">A table that lists actions taken on the PO, including the date and time,\nuser, action, and summary.</p><p class=\"p\">Actions performed by guided buying display as the user\n<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">aribasystem</span>.</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">View in SAP Ariba Procurement</span> to display the PO in\n<span class=\"ph\">SAP Ariba Procurement solutions</span>. You can\nthen save or print the PO. Choose <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Back</span> to return to the PO in\nguided buying.</span>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Choose the left arrow icon (<span class=\"SAP-icons-V5\"></span>) to return to <span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Your requests</span>.</span>\n</li></ol></section>\n</div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
}